    "title": "UwUnivers cosmic - Customizable animated space wallpaper",
    "description": "UwUnivers Cosmic is the fully customizable animated cosmic wallpaper of uwunivers.com\r\n\r\nThe cosmic scenery slowly moves and evolves throughout the day. Its seed changes daily, generating a new sky each day—so the wallpaper never remains permanently frozen, and no two days are strictly identical.\r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\n• Multiple UwUnivers visual themes\r\n• Custom main color and up to 3 accent colors\r\n• Custom star count from 0 to 999\r\n• Adjustable shuttle frequency\r\n• Adjustable shuttle frame rate\r\n• Adjustable maximum wallpaper frame rate\r\n• Daily deterministic sky shared with UwUnivers\r\n• Multi-monitor and dynamic-resolution support\r\n• Fully functional offline\r\n\r\nThe cosmic sky changes every day at 02:00 Europe/Paris while remaining identical for all users sharing the same daily seed.\r\n\r\nFor the smoothest shuttle animations, set Wallpaper Engine’s global frame rate to 60 FPS or higher. The wallpaper cannot exceed Wallpaper Engine’s global FPS limit.\r\n\r\nPatch note 2026-08-13 :\r\n- Added synchronization for live UwUnivers events, such as the Perseids.\r\n\r\nPatch note 2026-08-08 (Performance & Visual Quality Update) :\r\n- Added 3 animation modes: Full (1 FPS cosmic background), Eco (one refresh/minute), and Static Background (hourly refresh).\r\n- Significantly reduced GPU/iGPU usage.\r\n- Added dithering to reduce banding in dark and HDR themes.\r\n- Fixed black flashes when changing animation modes.\r\n- WebGL is now automatic, with Canvas used only as a compatibility fallback.\r\n- Shuttle rendering now fully pauses when frequency is set to 0.\r\n\r\n_________________________________________________________________\r\n© 2026 UwUnivers. All rights reserved. Licensed solely for personal use through Wallpaper Engine. Redistribution, re-uploading, extraction, modification, commercial use, or use outside Wallpaper Engine is prohibited without prior written permission. This restriction does not limit the rights granted